## 1. DEVICE IDENTIFICATION:
id: ab-flexlogix-1794-l34
name: "Allen-Bradley FlexLogix 1794-L34 — Logix5000 Controller, 512KB, 24VDC, 2x 1788-card slots, FLEX I/O backplane"
manufacturer: "Rockwell Automation (Allen-Bradley)"
mcu: "Rockwell 5434 (proprietary Logix5000 processor, 32-bit, hardware FPU)"
category: plc
